</ul>
<p>Easily guide users with clear, recognizable icons that make navigation a breeze. Say goodbye to lengthy design processes—our icons are ready to use, saving you time and effort. Download in both PNG and SVG formats.</p></div></div><div class="cell features" data-v-965509eb><h3 class="features__title" data-v-965509eb>Here&#39;s how to use Icons8</h3><div class="features__list" data-v-965509eb><!--[--><div class="feature" data-v-965509eb><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/icon/style-info/search.svg" alt="Browse" loading="lazy" data-v-965509eb><span class="feature__title" data-v-965509eb>Browse</span><p data-v-965509eb>Find the perfect icon</p></div><div class="feature" data-v-965509eb><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/icon/style-info/download.svg" alt="Download" loading="lazy" data-v-965509eb><span class="feature__title" data-v-965509eb>Download</span><p data-v-965509eb>Select your preferred format (PNG, SVG, PDF, GIF, JSON, or HTML code)</p></div><div class="feature" data-v-965509eb><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/icon/style-info/adjust.svg" alt="Modify and recolor" loading="lazy" data-v-965509eb><span class="feature__title" data-v-965509eb>Modify and recolor</span><p data-v-965509eb>Customize size, shape, and color</p></div><div class="feature" data-v-965509eb><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/icon/style-info/puzzle.svg" alt="Integrate" loading="lazy" data-v-965509eb><span class="feature__title" data-v-965509eb>Integrate</span><p data-v-965509eb>Incorporate the icon into your project</p></div><!--]--></div></div><div class="list-info" data-v-965509eb><h3 class="list-info__title" data-v-965509eb>About iOS 27 Filled style</h3><div class="app-benefits-style icons-platforms__benefits" data-v-965509eb data-v-993ff178><!--[--><div class="app-benefits-style__item" data-v-993ff178><div class="app-benefits-style__item-icon" data-v-993ff178><img src="https://maxst.icons8.com/vue-static/icon/benefits/icon-apple-compliant.svg" 